---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' Regression test: '-[nonode]->' must parse and force node style off for that
' one transition, even under a global 'skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle
' node' - including on a self-transition, which is how the real-world source
' this pins uses it. Before the fix, '[nonode]' wasn't a recognized arrow
' style keyword at all (the LINE_STYLE grammar only had 'node'), so the whole
' line failed to parse and fell back to "Syntax Error? (Assumed diagram type:
' state)".
skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node

state PoweringUp
state Charging

PoweringUp -[nonode]-> PoweringUp : selfCheckFailed [attempt < 3] / retry()
PoweringUp -> Charging : ready
@enduml
